sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Usuario
    participant CLI
    participant DISC as Agente descubrimiento
    participant PROV as LLMProvider
    participant LLM as API de LLM
    participant TOOLS as Tool-dispatcher
    participant FS as Repo clonado
    participant PIPE as Pipeline

    U->>CLI: normalizer URL --provider X
    CLI->>DISC: discover_from_url(url)
    DISC->>FS: clone --depth 1 + build_tree_summary
    loop hasta done o agotar presupuesto
        DISC->>PROV: chat(messages, tools)
        PROV->>LLM: petición HTTPS
        LLM-->>PROV: respuesta (tool_calls)
        PROV-->>DISC: ChatResponse
        DISC->>TOOLS: dispatch(call, state)
        TOOLS->>FS: list_dir | read_file | grep | select_evidence
        FS-->>TOOLS: resultado
        TOOLS-->>DISC: resultado como texto
    end
    DISC-->>CLI: directorio de evidencia
    CLI->>PIPE: run_pipeline(evidence_dir)
    PIPE->>PROV: generate(prompt_ANALYZE)
    PROV-->>PIPE: 02_analysis.md
    PIPE->>PROV: generate(prompt_DESIGN)
    PROV-->>PIPE: 03_design.md
    PIPE->>PROV: generate(prompt_DDL)
    PROV-->>PIPE: 04_ddl.sql
    PIPE-->>CLI: ruta al DDL